  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners: MicroMentor</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners aims to provide mentorship services after the incubation- and acceleration programmes have ended. At the moment, there is a lack of (Arabic speaking) mentors available for Orange Corners entrepreneurs in Sudan, Egypt, and the Palestinian Territories. MicroMentor provides a large network of local, international, online and offline mentors who provide tailor-made advise for entrepreneurs in Egypt, Sudan and the Palestinian Territories. With the help of MicroMentor&#x2019;s mentoring activities, the project partners&apos; can reach the goal to support under-resourced youth entrepreneurs and understand the critical importance of mentoring in the suite of necessary tools and resources to build more resilient and successful businesses.</narrative>
  </description>
